body.head:
NEVADA;


OR,


THE LOST MINE.

div.p:
Tom. Dick, where's my knife? (Looks round.) Gone! The cabin is upside down, no hatchet, no knife; nice housekeeper to leave when one goes a journey. There's his pack, and I want my knife; so, Master Dick, by your leave—(Picks up pack, and is at work on the strap; enter 
                  Agnes
                    from cabin.)
